docs {
  # Form5 Portal — API collection

  Exercises the whole backend: the student registration flow
  (register → presign → upload → complete) and the admin console
  (seed, stats, roster, CSV export, gated file view).

  ## Run order matters
  `01-register-flow` is a chain: each request saves vars that the next
  one reads (`{{ref}}`, `{{form5Url}}`, `{{fileId}}`). Run the folder
  top to bottom. `02-admin` is order-independent, except run `seed`
  before `stats`/`roster`/`export-csv` if you want the demo rows.

  ## CLI
  ```
  npm i -g @usebruno/cli
  bru run --env local
  ```
}
